# Secrets and machine-local runtime state.
#
# These are ALSO in .git/info/exclude. The duplication is deliberate: this repo is
# public (github.com/snits/claude-files) and holds credentials, so the ignore rules
# should not depend on one untracked file. .git/info/exclude is not versioned, so an
# editor accident that flattens it leaves no diff to notice — which happened
# 2026-08-15 and briefly un-ignored every path below. This file is tracked, so the
# same accident here shows up in `git status`.
#
# Backstop beyond both: .git/hooks/pre-commit refuses a commit that stages any of them.
.credentials.json
security/
mcp-needs-auth-cache.json
policy-limits.json
remote-settings.json
history.jsonl
logs/
telemetry/
channels/
jobs/
stats-cache.json
session-handoff.md
.last-cleanup
.last-update-result.json
last-evaluated-version

